            <p class="font-body text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-8">
                Unlike public cloud AI platforms, Tabiri Analytics operates on a decentralized "Sovereign Node" model. This is an isolated workspace tailored specifically for your organization.
            </p>
            <ul class="space-y-8">
                <li class="flex gap-4 items-start">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-accent mt-1">shield_with_heart</span>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="font-headline text-2xl md:text-headline-md mb-2 text-on-surface">Isolated Compute</h3>
                        <p class="text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
